secondary-origin) into a single helper. Each call site retains its
own bounds check, post-score filters (curve-mask gate, frame-line,
MISSING/require_evidence), and dict construction so JSON key order
stays byte-identical.

Also drops the 'nonlocal candidate_count' closure inside
find_local_gap_candidates: count via len(candidates) snapshots
captured before each model iteration and before the endpoint loop.

